  "details": "1.Open Unity 6 VRChat\n\n2.Join this world (背叛书·上 Book of Betrayals Pt.1 [CN] https://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_acff8904-fb49-44b8-8351-caf50883c8e5 )\n\n3.Click the 我理解，显示正文(I understand,show the main text) button under the Content Warning(Figure 1)\n\n4.Observe the stone slabs marked with numbers. In open-beta (Figure 2), they display normally, while in Unity 6 (Figure 3), nothing is displayed.",
